# T1-R (iOS Diag T1R, commit 51e48829f, Mac hashes in ERISTA_T1R_RUN.md) on a physical Erista (t210b01=0, sku=0), 2026-11-26, hekate 6.5.5, started from Nyx More configs.
# Transcribed by the reviewer from three photographs (P1 and P2 on the U-Boot console, P3 on the loader screen), which were also read here.
# The run completed, the loader reset and hekate came back by itself. Nyx then showed an SoC temperature of 38.7 C (operator report, not part of the values below).
# The video is 25.73 s long and hekate was back after about 24 s (operator report).
# Not transcribed: the HCR value of the EL1 line (not legible). The last digit of the PLLP word in the P1 and P2 photographs is not legible (the ASCII column shows only its high bytes); P3 prints it.
# RST_L reads 04D102CA at all three points. T1 v2 recorded 049102CA in its own photograph; the difference is bit 22 (USBD in hekate's names). Whether one transcription is wrong or the state differs between runs is not settled.
